  "body": "It's not clear from https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request which fields another specification needs to set in order to [fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-fetch) the request. I believe https://www.w3.org/TR/appmanifest/#obtaining forgets to set the client as a result.\r\n\r\nI think the required fields are:\r\n\r\n* [client](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-client) (because [fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-fetch) uses \"request’s client’s global object\" without checking whether the client is null)\r\n* [URL](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-url)",
